SUMMARY:Niagara Glen\, Whirpool & Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup location: Niagara Gl
 en Nature Centre\, 3050 Niagara River Pkwy\, Niagara Falls\, ON L0S 1J0**\
 n**(GPS Coordinates: 43.12931329884384\, -79.06036489891335)**\n**Parking 
 Cost: Parking is not free. It costs $8.50 per hour (not advisable) or $35.
 00 per year.**\nDrop-off Points: The first drop-off point will be just bef
 ore we exit the Glen. The second drop-off point will be at the Whirlpool\,
  after lunch.\nHighlights: Scenic rock formation\, rapids\, whirlpool\, wa
 terfalls\, spectacular views\n**Niagara Falls Hiking Adventure** 🌿\nI l
 ove\, love\, love this!\nJoin us for an absolutely scenic day of hiking an
 d exploring one of Ontario's most beautiful natural areas!\nWe'll enjoy a 
 moderate challenging hike -the end is a bit challenging - just saying.alon
 g the Niagara River\, taking in stunning views of the gorge\, rapids\, and
  of course\, the world-famous Niagara Falls. Along the way we'll stop for 
 photos\, enjoy the fresh air\, and connect with our fellow hikers!\n**What
  to Expect:**\n🥾 Moderate hiking pace\n📸 Plenty of photo opportuniti
 es\n🌊 Spectacular views of the Niagara River and Falls\n🤝 Friendly c
 onversation and new connections\n🍴 Dinner afterwards\n**Please Bring:**
 \n\n* Comfortable hiking shoes\n* LOTS of Water and snacks\n* Weather-appr
 opriate clothing\n* Camera or phone for photos\n\nWhether you're a regular
  hiker or simply looking for a fun day outdoors\, everyone is welcome. Com
 e enjoy the beauty of Niagara Falls and meet some great people along the w
 ay!\nLooking forward to hiking with you!
